  eyetoad.com — XML Sitemap
  Rebuilt 2026-08-05

  WHAT WAS WRONG WITH THE PREVIOUS VERSION (all four are real):

  1. EVERY URL WAS www.eyetoad.com. Every canonical, og:url and
     JSON-LD @id on this site is APEX. The sitemap was therefore
     telling Google to index one host while every page declared a
     different one. Now apex throughout. Never reintroduce www.

  2. ALL SEVEN LOCATION URLs WERE 404s. The file listed
     /seo-arvada/, /seo-lakewood/ and so on. The live pages are at
     /locations/arvada-seo/, /locations/lakewood-seo/, etc. Seven
     dead URLs were being actively submitted to Google.

  3. FIVE LIVE CITY PAGES WERE MISSING ENTIRELY — Thornton,
     Westminster, Centennial, Highlands Ranch and Parker. Thirteen
     city pages exist; seven wrong ones were listed.

  4. NINE LIVE PAGES WERE MISSING, including three of the highest
     converting URLs on the site: /free-seo-audit/,
     /denver-seo-pricing/ and /marketing-subscription/.

  ============================================================
  WHY THERE IS NO <changefreq> OR <priority> ANY MORE:
  Google ignores both. They are vestigial from the 2005 spec.
  Keeping them meant maintaining two fields that do nothing and
  drift out of sync with reality. Removing them costs nothing.

  WHY SOME ENTRIES HAVE NO <lastmod>:
  Deliberate. An inaccurate lastmod is worse than none — Google
  will stop trusting the field across the WHOLE sitemap if the
  dates do not match reality. The old file claimed 2026-03-01 for
  everything, including pages rebuilt in July. Dates below appear
  only where the real modification date is known. Add a lastmod
  when you next genuinely edit a page, and only then.
  ============================================================

  MAINTENANCE RULE: when you add a page, add it here in the same
  commit and submit the sitemap in Search Console. When you change
  a URL, change it here — a sitemap full of 404s wastes crawl
  budget and signals a poorly maintained site.
  ============================================================
-->
